&lt;li&gt;As part of the Talent Acquisition leadership team, co-create and drive the implementation of TA strategy and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior business leaders and hiring managers to co-create and

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Staff Software Engineer: Applied AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, thousands of shipments cross borders, change hands, and hit unexpected problems. For decades, fixing those problems meant phone calls, emails, and humans heroically firefighting. We think that&#39;s about to change completely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve been building AI agents that spot trouble before it happens, reroute shipments, and keep goods moving—with our team of experts in the loop where it counts. The early results have been jaw-dropping. We&#39;re now going all in on a future where supply chains run themselves, and we&#39;re looking for the people who want to build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where you join a team and pick up tickets. You&#39;ll find the highest-leverage problems, design the solutions, and ship them to operators moving freight across 112 countries. If that sounds like your idea of a good time, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the cutting-edge agents and AI-powered applications that make Flexport&#39;s operations smarter, faster, and increasingly autonomous. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and shipping &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end AI agents&lt;/strong&gt; that handle real logistics work—customs compliance, document processing, exception management, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crossing organizational boundaries&lt;/strong&gt; to understand problems deeply, align stakeholders, and get things done without waiting for permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving fast from idea to production, treating every deployment as a learning opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with operators, domain experts, and leadership to turn ambiguous problems into shipped solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Should Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;; you&#39;ve built with LLMs extensively — whether in production, side projects, or just because you couldn&#39;t stop yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product instincts&lt;/strong&gt;: you can identify what&#39;s worth building, not just execute on a spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: agent patterns, RAG, prompt engineering, tool use, evaluation. You know what works in production and what looks good in demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack capability&lt;/strong&gt; in TypeScript and Next.js—you can own a feature end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial drive&lt;/strong&gt;: you thrive in ambiguity, move fast, and don&#39;t wait to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication&lt;/strong&gt;: you can work across teams and disciplines to get alignment and unblock yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An audacious appetite for impact&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;re not here to maintain—you&#39;re here to change how global trade w

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager – Data Engineering &amp;amp; Machine Learning, you’ll lead Catawiki’s established team of Data Engineers and Machine Learning specialists. You’ll help the team grow, set its technical direction and build on work already underway across data foundations and production machine learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role spans two connected disciplines. You’ll bring deep experience in either Data Engineering or Machine Learning Engineering, and enough breadth to set direction across the other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business stakeholders to set priorities and connect the team’s work to outcomes across Catawiki.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead the team through platform modernisation and product-facing ML work. Current priorities include modernising the infrastructure for serving production models, introducing a feature store to improve feature management and consistency across model training and serving, and strengthening observability and cost controls. You’ll help set priorities and raise the reliability and impact of this work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Set direction, coach experienced specialists and create clear ownership across Data Engineering and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build dependable data foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve the pipelines, integrations and infrastructure the wider Data team relies on for analysis, reporting and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen production ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve deployment, monitoring and operational follow-through for production models, so teams can run them reliably and resolve issues effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance marketplace models:&lt;/strong&gt; Help teams improve recommendation, cancellation and bidder-risk use cases, connecting model performance to meaningful product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set direction and priorities:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business partners to choose high-value problems and balance delivery, reliability and long-term platform health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the technology strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Reporting to the SVP Engineering, you’ll join the Engineering Management team and help shape the direction of the Technology department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&

