&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media &amp;amp; Stakeholder knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll have a nose for news and a sharp understanding of the political, regulatory and media environment, and know how to develop insightful corporate and public affairs strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
